{
  "schema_version": "1.2",
  "_notes": [
    "Shared field schema for the Hoos' Cooking price-reporting form (HTML form, printed/handwritten form, and the PDF extraction tool all derive from this file).",
    "v1.2 change: expanded Colombia (COL) fixed item lists, sourced from DANE SIPSA's actual wholesale product names plus common pantry/dairy staples, and removed the v1.1 draft warning. Confirmed by team review.",
    "COL group sizes intentionally differ from NGA's uniform 15 (12 for oils_fats): legumes_nuts_seeds has 6 items and oils_fats has 10 -- this reflects genuinely less retail variety in Colombian markets for these two groups, not a shortcut. Vegetables, fruits, starchy_staples, and animal_source_foods all reached 15.",
    "v1.1 change: expanded Nigeria (NGA) fixed item lists from 4-5 items/group to up to 15/group, and raised write_in_slots_per_group from 2 to 3, per team decision to favor a longer fixed checklist over open write-in rows (keeps handwriting OCR limited to prices, not item names).",
    "Nigeria (NGA) item lists beyond the original 4-5 mock items are a FIRST-PASS DRAFT cross-referenced from general food/travel sources, not a rigorous consumption survey. Recommended follow-up: validate against FAOSTAT Food Balance Sheets (per-capita food supply by commodity, Nigeria) and/or local knowledge before finalizing.",
    "oils_fats for NGA intentionally has only 12 items, not 15 -- could not identify 3 more genuinely common, distinct cooking oils/fats without padding with implausible entries.",
    "food_groups follow the FAO Cost and Affordability of a Healthy Diet (CoAHD) six-group structure."
  ],

  "form_id_prefix": "CRP",

  "food_groups": [
    { "id": "starchy_staples",       "label": "Starchy Staples" },
    { "id": "vegetables",            "label": "Vegetables" },
    { "id": "fruits",                "label": "Fruits" },
    { "id": "animal_source_foods",   "label": "Animal Source Foods" },
    { "id": "legumes_nuts_seeds",    "label": "Legumes, Nuts & Seeds" },
    { "id": "oils_fats",             "label": "Oils & Fats" }
  ],

  "header_fields": [
    { "id": "form_id",          "label": "Form ID",                 "type": "string", "auto_generated": true },
    { "id": "market_location",  "label": "Market / Location",       "type": "string", "required": true },
    { "id": "vendor_stall_id",  "label": "Vendor / Stall ID",       "type": "string", "required": true },
    { "id": "region_district",  "label": "Region / District",       "type": "string", "required": true },
    { "id": "country",          "label": "Country",                 "type": "enum",   "values": ["NGA", "COL"], "required": true },
    { "id": "date",             "label": "Date",                    "type": "date",   "required": true },
    { "id": "currency",         "label": "Currency",                "type": "string", "derived_from": "country", "required": true },
    { "id": "collected_by",     "label": "Collected By (enumerator)", "type": "string", "required": false },
    { "id": "source_channel",   "label": "Source Channel",          "type": "enum",   "values": ["html_form", "paper_scan"], "required": true }
  ],

  "write_in_slots_per_group": 3,

